# Docker Backup - Git 忽略规则

# ===== 备份产出目录 =====
backup-*/
backup-images-*/
backup-compose-*/
backup-volumes-*/

# ===== 敏感信息 =====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ===== 临时文件 =====
*.tmp
*.log
*.pid

# ===== 数据卷归档 =====
*.tar.gz
*.tar
!volumes/*.tar.gz
!volumes/manifest.txt
!volumes/summary.txt

# ===== IDE/OS =====
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
